/* ═══════════ v113 · 本日计划清单：整卡收起 / 逐行开合过渡 / 一键展开按钮贴最右（原型 dsh-web-v116） ═══════════ */
.dpm .sched .plcard-fold { flex: none; position: relative; width: 24px; height: 24px; margin-left: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); border-radius: 7px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-layer-1); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); cursor: pointer; transition: color 120ms var(--ease), border-color 120ms var(--ease), background-color 120ms var(--ease); }
.dpm .sched .plcard-fold svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; margin: auto; width: 15px; height: 15px; display: block; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2.1; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; transform: rotate(180deg); transition: transform 220ms var(--ease); }
.dpm .sched .plcard-fold:hover { color: var(--pm-brand); border-color: var(--pm-brand-line); background: var(--pm-brand-soft); }
.dpm .sched .plcard-fold:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--pm-brand); outline-offset: 1px; }
.dpm .sched .tpc.min .plcard-fold svg { transform: none; }
.dpm .sched .tpc.min .tpc-h { border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 13px; }
/* v118（2）：右侧一整簇 = 提示 / 收起全部 / 只显示可安排 / 箭头（间距 6px，整体贴右） */
.dpm .sched #tpPlanCard .pltools { flex: none; margin-left: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; }
.dpm .sched #tpPlanCard .pltools .tpc-hint { margin-left: 0; flex: 0 1 auto; }
.dpm .sched #tpPlanCard .pltools .plbtns { flex: none; gap: 6px; }
/* v118（1）：收起 / 展开的高度全由引擎写成 px —— 这里只给过渡和内容淡出，动画结束不再改任何东西 */
.dpm .sched .tp-pair > .tpc { flex: 0 0 auto; }
.dpm .sched .tp-pair > .tp-split { flex: 0 0 auto; min-height: 0; height: 10px; overflow: hidden; transition: height 260ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1), opacity 160ms linear; }
.dpm .sched .tp-pair.anim > .tpc { transition: height 260ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1); }
.dpm .sched .tp-pair > #tpPlanCard .tpc-b { transition: opacity 170ms linear, transform 280ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1); }
.dpm .sched .tp-pair.folded > #tpPlanCard .tpc-b { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(9px); pointer-events: none; }
.dpm .sched .tp-pair.folded > .tp-split { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
/* 逐行开合 = grid 行过渡（不重画、不闪） */
.dpm .sched .plchildren, .dpm .sched .plsub { display: grid; grid-template-rows: 0fr; transition: grid-template-rows 220ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1); }
.dpm .sched .plchildren.open, .dpm .sched .plsub.open { grid-template-rows: 1fr; }
.dpm .sched .plchildren > .plc-in, .dpm .sched .plsub > .plc-in { min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
#tpPlanCard .tpc-h { flex-wrap: nowrap; }
/* v118（2）：放不下整簇（≤500）→ 整簇折到第二行、贴右；更窄才隐提示文字 / 收紧按钮 */
