/* ═══ v147（1）+ v148（1）：执行卡悬停不展开 —— 按钮放在第二行小字的位置（靠左），小字淡出、按钮淡入；第二行常态 30px 高，按钮 24×32 在行内居中 ═══ */
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi:not(.hx-sq) { padding-bottom: 8px !important; }
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi .exi-s { height: 30px !important; line-height: 30px !important; transition: opacity 140ms ease; }
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi.v47h .exi-s { opacity: 0 !important; }
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi.v47h.v47h > .exslot { grid-area: auto !important; position: absolute !important; inset: auto !important; left: var(--v47x) !important; top: var(--v47y) !important; width: var(--v47w) !important; height: 24px !important; right: auto !important; bottom: auto !important; transform: none !important; padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important; background: none !important; z-index: 3; display: flex !important; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-start; overflow: hidden; }
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi.v47h.v47h > .exslot > .exacts { display: flex !important; flex-direction: row !important; flex-wrap: nowrap; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 5px !important; width: auto !important; height: 24px; opacity: 1 !important; pointer-events: auto !important; position: static !important; transform: none !important; animation: dpm-v47in 140ms ease both; }
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi.v47h.v47h > .exslot > .exacts > .exa { flex: 0 0 auto !important; width: 32px !important; min-width: 0 !important; height: 24px !important; padding: 0 !important; border-radius: 7px !important; }
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi.v47h.v47h > .exslot > .exacts > .exa svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; }
@keyframes dpm-v47in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dpm .sched #exBody .exi.v47h > .exslot > .exacts { animation: none; } .dpm .sched #exBody .exi .exi-s { transition: none; } }
/* v149（1）：彩色悬停按钮去白边 —— 描边 = 按钮色加深 18%（原来是 55% 白 + 按钮色，在彩色卡上是一圈浅环），投影只用深色 */
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi .exa[data-to] { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, #000 18%, var(--to)) !important; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 17, 21, .22) !important; }
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi .exa[data-to]:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi .exa[data-to]:active { filter: brightness(.94); transform: translateY(.5px); }
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi .exa[data-to]:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #fff; outline-offset: 1px; }
/* v148（2）：卡片详情「以此卡片新建会话」= 黑底白字（深色主题仍黑底 + 浅描边） */
.dpm-global-detail .d-f [data-open-card], .dpm .d-f [data-open-card] { background: #111 !important; border-color: #111 !important; color: #fff !important; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, .55) !important; }
.dpm-global-detail .d-f [data-open-card]:hover, .dpm .d-f [data-open-card]:hover { background: #2a2a2a !important; border-color: #2a2a2a !important; }
.dpm-global-detail .d-f [data-open-card]:active, .dpm .d-f [data-open-card]:active { background: #000 !important; transform: translateY(1px); }
.dpm-global-detail .d-f [data-open-card]:focus-visible, .dpm .d-f [data-open-card]:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--pm-brand); outline-offset: 2px; }
.dpm-global-detail .d-f [data-open-card] svg, .dpm .d-f [data-open-card] svg { stroke: #fff; color: #fff; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-global-detail .d-f [data-open-card], body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm .d-f [data-open-card] { background: #0a0a0a !important; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .22) !important; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-global-detail .d-f [data-open-card]:hover, body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm .d-f [data-open-card]:hover { background: #1c1c1c !important; }
/* v149（2）：带子任务的任务卡拖动浮卡 —— 保留原卡布局类（gantt.ts exStart），高度按内容，浮卡里的子任务小卡单独一套只读样式（浮卡挂在 body，不在 .dpm .sched 下） */
.exi.exi-ghost.v49g { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: hidden; padding-top: 6px !important; padding-bottom: 8px !important; }
.exi.exi-ghost.v49g.v41grp { grid-template-rows: 22px auto auto !important; grid-template-areas: "ck t sl rc" "s s s s" "sb sb sb sb" !important; }
.exi.exi-ghost.v49g.v41grp.v40has { grid-template-areas: "ck t sl rc" "s s s cs" "sb sb sb sb" !important; }
.exi.exi-ghost.v49g.v41grp.nock { grid-template-areas: "t sl rc" "s s s" "sb sb sb" !important; }
.exi.exi-ghost.v49g.v41grp.norec { grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto !important; grid-template-areas: "ck t sl" "s s s" "sb sb sb" !important; }
.exi.exi-ghost.v49g.v41grp.norec.v40has { grid-template-areas: "ck t sl" "s s cs" "sb sb sb" !important; }
.exi.exi-ghost.v49g .exi-s { height: 30px !important; line-height: 30px !important; }
.exi.exi-ghost.v49g > .exgrip { position: absolute !important; left: 1px; top: 0; bottom: 0; height: auto !important; grid-area: auto !important; }
.exi-ghost.v49g > .v40ex { grid-area: cs; justify-self: end; }
.exi-ghost.v49g > .v41subs { grid-area: sb; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; min-width: 0; margin: 4px 0 1px; }
.exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; height: 26px; padding: 0 6px 0 4px; border-radius: 7px; background: #fff; color: #1f2329; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 17, 21, .07); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 17, 21, .06); font-size: 11.5px; }
.exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr .v41grip, .exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr > button, .exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr .v42nb, .exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr .v41rec, .exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr [data-ex-ck] { display: none !important; }
.exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr .v41st { flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
.exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr .v41cs { flex: none; display: inline-flex; max-width: 45%; overflow: hidden; }
.exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr .v41cs .dpm-sst { height: 18px; font-size: 10px; }
.exi-ghost.v49g .v49ck { flex: none; width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid #9aa0a6; background: #fff; }
.exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr.done .v49ck { background: #16a34a; border-color: #16a34a; }
.exi-ghost.v49g .v41sr.done .v41st { color: #8a9099; text-decoration: line-through; }
.exi-ghost.v49g .v49more { height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 6px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--cfg, #fff); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cfg, #fff) 16%, transparent); }
.exi-ghost.v49g .exacts, .exi-ghost.v49g .exslot .exa { display: none !important; }

/* ═══ v143（2）会话状态标签 ═══
   (2) 字色 / 底色锁死：根因 = 「.dpm button { color: inherit }」比标签自己的颜色规则优先级高 → 执行卡里白字白底、详情里黑字。用更高优先级写死前景 / 背景（执行卡、计划清单、详情、气泡窗、弹窗都一样）。
   (1) 执行中：左侧绿色渐变块里白色转圈（HTML 伪元素 = 合成层动画，主线程忙也不卡）+ 一道浅绿光带 2.4s 扫过（只动 transform）；去掉原来闪的外圈。动画用 --dpm-ph 负延迟对齐全局时钟，重画不重来。
   (3) 新状态「会话完成输出」= Agent 输出完、你还没看：实心绿渐变 + 白字 + 对勾气泡 + 外发光脉冲 + 白色光带。 */
.dpm-sst.s-done, .dpm-spi.s-done { --c: #059669; }
.dpm-sst { --fg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 66%, #000); --bgc: #fff; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-sst { --fg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 66%, #fff); --bgc: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 16%, #1d1d1f); }
.dpm .sched #exBody .dpm-sst, body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm .sched #exBody .dpm-sst, .exbub .dpm-sst, body[data-ds-dark-theme] .exbub .dpm-sst, .exi-ghost .dpm-sst { --fg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 66%, #000); --bgc: #fff; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, .dpm-dp, .dpm-pop, .dpm-sicrow, .exbub, .exi-ghost, .dpm-global-detail, body) .dpm-sst { color: var(--fg) !important; background: var(--bgc) !important; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, .dpm-dp, .dpm-pop, .dpm-sicrow, .exbub, .dpm-global-detail, body) button.dpm-sst:hover, :is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, .dpm-dp, .dpm-pop, .dpm-sicrow, .exbub, .dpm-global-detail, body) button.dpm-sst:focus-visible { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 15%, var(--bgc)) !important; }
.dpm-sst .lb { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.dpm-sst.s-run .ic { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #22c55e, #15803d) !important; }
.dpm-sst.s-run .ic svg { display: none !important; }
.dpm-sst.s-run .ic::before { content: ""; width: 8px; height: 8px; border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .35); border-top-color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; animation: dpm-sspin .8s linear infinite; animation-delay: var(--dpm-ph, 0ms); will-change: transform; }
.dpm-sst.s-run::after { content: "" !important; position: absolute; inset: 0 !important; border-radius: inherit; box-shadow: none !important; opacity: 1 !important; background: linear-gradient(100deg, transparent 30%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 26%, transparent) 50%, transparent 70%); transform: translateX(-100%); animation: dpm-ssh 2.4s cubic-bezier(.45, 0, .25, 1) infinite !important; animation-delay: var(--dpm-ph, 0ms) !important; pointer-events: none; }
@keyframes dpm-ssh { 0% { transform: translateX(-100%); } 62%, 100% { transform: translateX(100%); } }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, .dpm-dp, .dpm-pop, .dpm-sicrow, .exbub, .exi-ghost, .dpm-global-detail, body) .dpm-sst.s-done { color: #fff !important; background: linear-gradient(115deg, #10b981 0%, #047857 100%) !important; border-color: transparent !important; animation: dpm-sglow 2.2s ease-out infinite; animation-delay: var(--dpm-ph, 0ms); }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, .dpm-dp, .dpm-pop, .dpm-sicrow, .exbub, .dpm-global-detail, body) button.dpm-sst.s-done:hover, :is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, .dpm-dp, .dpm-pop, .dpm-sicrow, .exbub, .dpm-global-detail, body) button.dpm-sst.s-done:focus-visible { background: linear-gradient(115deg, #0ea371 0%, #036b4f 100%) !important; }
.dpm-sst.s-done .ic { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .2) !important; color: #fff !important; }
.dpm-sst.s-done::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: inherit; background: linear-gradient(100deg, transparent 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .38) 50%, transparent 70%); transform: translateX(-100%); animation: dpm-ssh 2.2s cubic-bezier(.45, 0, .25, 1) infinite; animation-delay: var(--dpm-ph, 0ms); pointer-events: none; }
@keyframes dpm-sglow { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, .55); } 70%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0); } }
.dpm-spi.s-done { background: #059669 !important; color: #fff !important; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dpm-sst.s-run::after, .dpm-sst.s-done::after, .dpm-sst.s-done, .dpm-sst.s-run .ic::before { animation: none !important; } }
/* v143（4B）：详情任务卡上的状态标签可以缩，更换 / 新建会话两颗按钮不缩、永远在卡片里 */
.dpm-stc { min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; }
.dpm-stc > .dpm-sst { flex: 0 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
.dpm-stc > .dpm-sib, .dpm-stc > .dpm-slk { flex: none; }

/* v143（3.1）：「添加为… / 使用引用内容」气泡字号 / 颜色锁死（弹窗里「按钮继承父级字体和颜色」的重置曾把它改成 15px 深色字，深蓝底上看不清）：12px 白字、图标 13px、右侧小字 11px 78% 白、高 26px、细白描边 */
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, dialog, body) button.dpm-cbub { height: 26px; padding: 0 9px 0 7px; gap: 5px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .14); font: 600 12px/1 system-ui, -apple-system, "PingFang SC", sans-serif !important; color: #fff !important; letter-spacing: 0; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, dialog, body) button.dpm-cbub span { color: #fff; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, dialog, body) button.dpm-cbub small { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78); opacity: 1; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, dialog, body) button.dpm-cbub small.cmdh { font-size: 10.5px; padding-left: 6px; margin-left: 1px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .3); }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog, dialog, body) button.dpm-cbub svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; color: #fff; }

/* v143（4A）：详情气泡窗的箭头 = 窗外的三角（clip-path）+ 1px 描边，不再是压在窗内滚动条上的旋转白方块 */
/* v143（4C）：详情子任务卡内边距 8px、卡片之间 6px；选中蓝框 1.5px + 3px 外晕，和标题 / 状态行之间留出空隙 */
:is(.dpm .detail, .dpm-global-detail) .kids > .task.child:not(.done) { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; border-radius: 11px !important; }
:is(.dpm .detail, .dpm-global-detail) .kids > .task.child:not(.done) + .task.child { margin-top: 6px !important; }
:is(.dpm .detail, .dpm-global-detail) .kids > .task.child:not(.done) > .tkhead { padding: 8px 8px 8px 6px !important; border-radius: 11px; }
:is(.dpm .detail, .dpm-global-detail) .kids > .task.child:not(.done) > .tkhead > .tkst { margin-top: 5px; }
:is(.dpm .detail, .dpm-global-detail, .dpm-detail-only .detail) .task.child > .tkhead.dpm-dpsrc { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--pm-brand), 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand) 14%, transparent) !important; }

/* v143（5.1）：会话信息卡展开 / 收起时，「卡片详情」按钮贴着输入框那一侧（底对齐），位置一像素不动 */
.dpm-sicrow > .dpm-sopen { align-self: flex-end; }

/* v143（6）：侧栏「今天」= 和「项目看板」「任务日程看板」同一套特效层（.hfx：rim / spot / sheen / ripple）+ 进入脉冲，只换红色 */
.dpm-today { isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden; }
.dpm-today > .hfx { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; border-radius: inherit; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }
.dpm-today > .hfx .rim { position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: inherit; padding: 1.5px; background: conic-gradient(from var(--dpm-rim), transparent 0 62%, var(--dpm-a) 76%, #fda4af 86%, transparent 96%); -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#000 0 0); -webkit-mask-composite: xor; mask-composite: exclude; opacity: 0; }
.dpm-today:hover > .hfx .rim { animation: dpm-rim 1100ms var(--ease) both; }
.dpm-today > .hfx .spot { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(90px circle at var(--dpm-mx, 50%) var(--dpm-my, 50%), rgba(255, 255, 255, .55), transparent 60%); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 200ms var(--ease); }
.dpm-today:hover > .hfx .spot { opacity: .5; }
.dpm-today[aria-pressed="true"]:hover > .hfx .spot { opacity: .26; }
.dpm-today > .hfx .sheen { position: absolute; top: -20%; bottom: -20%; left: 0; width: 38%; background: linear-gradient(100deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, .55), transparent); transform: translateX(-120%) skewX(-16deg); opacity: 0; }
.dpm-today:hover > .hfx .sheen { animation: dpm-sheen 900ms 80ms var(--ease) both; }
.dpm-today.fx > .hfx .sheen { animation: dpm-sheen 900ms 180ms var(--ease) both; }
.dpm-today > .hfx .ripple { position: absolute; left: var(--dpm-rx, 50%); top: var(--dpm-ry, 50%); width: 16px; height: 16px; margin: -8px 0 0 -8px; border-radius: 50%; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dpm-a) 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .55)); opacity: 0; }
.dpm-today.tap > .hfx .ripple { animation: dpm-ripple 650ms var(--ease) both; }
.dpm-today.fx { animation: dpm-tburst 640ms var(--ease); }
@keyframes dpm-tburst { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(220, 38, 38, .45); } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0); } }
.dpm-today.rail > .hfx { display: none; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dpm-today > .hfx *, .dpm-today.fx { animation: none !important; } }

/* v143（1.2）：详情勾完成 → 自动记录执行写好后，执行安排里那颗「记录执行」按下动画闪一下 */
.dpm .sched #exBody .exrec.dpm-recfl, .dpm .sched #exBody .v41rec.dpm-recfl { animation: dpm-recfl 820ms cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1); }
@keyframes dpm-recfl { 0% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(22, 163, 74, .6); } 30% { transform: scale(.9); } 60% { transform: scale(1.06); box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(22, 163, 74, 0); } 100% { transform: scale(1); } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dpm .sched #exBody .exrec.dpm-recfl, .dpm .sched #exBody .v41rec.dpm-recfl { animation: none; } }

/* v144（1）：相关说明新增 / 编辑 = 任务弹窗同一个窗口的说明模式 —— 任务专属部分不出现，底部多一行「自动注入 Agent 会话」开关 + 字数 */
.dpm-goaltask[data-note] .gt-meta, .dpm-goaltask[data-note] .gt-pair, .dpm-goaltask[data-note] [data-gt-gen], .dpm-goaltask[data-note] [data-gt-cfg], .dpm-goaltask[data-note] .gt-genwhy, .dpm-goaltask[data-note] .dpm-gff { display: none !important; }
.dpm-goaltask[data-note] .gt-desc { flex: 1 1 auto; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-nrow { flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0 18px; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l1); border-radius: 10px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand-soft) 45%, transparent); font-size: 12px; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-nrow[hidden] { display: none; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-nrow b { font-weight: 650; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-nrow small { color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 11px; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-nrow .grow { flex: 1; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-nrow .k { flex: none; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 11.5px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

/* v144（4.1）：信息卡 + 卡片详情按钮那一行背后完全透明（消息滚到它后面仍看得见），从信息卡底边往下 18px 渐变到输入框的实底 */
@property --dpm-seat-top { syntax: "<length>"; inherits: false; initial-value: 0px; }
[data-dpm-seat][class*="composerSeat"] { background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0, transparent var(--dpm-seat-top), var(--dsw-alias-bg-base) calc(var(--dpm-seat-top) + 18px)) !important; }

/* v144（5.3）：点「今天」→ 表头那一格闪一下 */
.dpm .sched #headT .sc-cell.dpm-tdfl { animation: dpm-tdfl 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1); }
@keyframes dpm-tdfl { 0%, 100% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 0 transparent; } 25%, 60% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #dc2626; background: rgba(220, 38, 38, .12); } }

/* v146：「执行中」小标签（计划清单 / 甘特行名 / 看板卡片）= 绿底 + 呼吸点；看板卡片绿色描边 */
.dpm-runz { flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; height: 18px; padding: 0 7px; margin: 0 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap; vertical-align: middle; }
.dpm-runz i { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #16a34a; animation: dpm-runz 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes dpm-runz { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: .35; } }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-runz { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, .18); color: #86efac; }
.dpm .card.dpm-runcard { box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px #16a34a, 0 6px 16px -10px rgba(22, 163, 74, .6) !important; }
.dpm .card > .dpm-runz { position: absolute; right: 8px; bottom: 8px; margin: 0; }
.dpm .card.dpm-runcard { position: relative; }
.dpm .sched #rows .ind-cell .dpm-runz { height: 16px; font-size: 9.5px; padding: 0 6px; margin: 0 0 0 4px; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dpm-runz i { animation: none; } }

/* v146：会话开始工作 → 执行安排里那张卡挪进「执行中」后闪一下绿框 */
.dpm .sched #exBody .exi.dpm-runfl { animation: dpm-runfl 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1); }
@keyframes dpm-runfl { 0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 transparent; } 20%, 60% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #22c55e, 0 0 18px rgba(34, 197, 94, .5); } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dpm .sched #exBody .exi.dpm-runfl { animation: none; } }

/* v145（2.3）：相关说明项选中框收在说明卡片里（内阴影，不外扩、不压抓手）；下一条的分隔线选中时隐藏；标题过长省略 */
:is(.dpm-detail-only, .dpm-global-detail) .detail .nk.dpm-dpsrc { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--pm-brand), inset 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand) 12%, transparent) !important; border-radius: 10px; }
:is(.dpm-detail-only, .dpm-global-detail) .detail .nk.dpm-dpsrc + .nk { border-top-color: transparent !important; }
:is(.dpm-detail-only, .dpm-global-detail) .detail .nk .nk-t, :is(.dpm-detail-only, .dpm-global-detail) .detail .nk .nkt { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }

/* v144（5.2）：项目看板标题栏 / 卡片组管理栏空间不够 → 折两行（标题 + 说明一行省略，搜索 / 导入 / 新建在第二行，搜索框自己收缩），窄于 560 藏说明；按钮文字永远一行。
   容器查询挂在两条栏自己身上（不挂 .dpm：layout containment 会让 .dpm 成为 fixed 弹窗的包含块） */
.dpm .pm-top, .dpm .pm-mgr { container-type: inline-size; }
.dpm .pm-top .btn, .dpm .pm-mgr .btn, .dpm .pm-mgr .lbl, .dpm .pm-mgr .stat, .dpm .pm-top h1 { white-space: nowrap; }
.dpm .pm-top .btn, .dpm .pm-mgr .btn { flex: none; }
/* 栏左右各 24px 内边距：内容宽 772 / 512 = 看板宽 820 / 560 */
@container (max-width: 772px) {
  .dpm .pm-top .ttl { flex: 1 1 100%; }
  .dpm .pm-top .ttl p { white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .dpm .pm-top .search { flex: 1 1 140px; min-width: 120px; width: auto; }
  .dpm .pm-mgr .grow { display: none; }
}
@container (max-width: 512px) {
  .dpm .pm-top .ttl p { display: none; }
  .dpm .pm-mgr .lbl { display: none; }
}

/* ═══ v143（1.1）/ v145（4）：每日任务面板 = 独立一列（和卡片详情 / DSH 右侧栏 / Android 平级），宽度和位置只由排版引擎（board.ts rlLay）写 ═══ */
.dpm.dpm-tpcol { position: fixed; top: 0; bottom: 0; right: var(--dpm-col-r, 0px); width: var(--dpm-col-w, 380px); height: auto; z-index: 79; min-width: 0; }
.dpm.dpm-tpcol[hidden] { display: none !important; }
.dpm.dpm-tpcol[data-dpm-col="away"] { visibility: hidden !important; pointer-events: none; }
.dpm.dpm-tpcol > .sched { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
.dpm.dpm-tpcol .sched .tp { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: auto !important; min-width: 0; z-index: 1; }
.dpm.dpm-tpcol .sched.tp-resizing { cursor: col-resize; user-select: none; }
.dpm-global-detail[data-dpm-gd="w"] { right: var(--dpm-gd-r, 0px) !important; }
/* 放不下 = 最早打开的那列收成右边 44px 竖条（写着名字，没有被关掉），点 = 换到前面 */
.dpm-coltabs { position: fixed; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 86; display: flex; flex-direction: row-reverse; }
.dpm-coltabs[hidden] { display: none; }
.dpm-coltab { width: 44px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 14px 0; border: 0; border-left: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2, #e5e7eb); background: color-mix(in srgb, #2f5fcc 9%, var(--dsw-alias-bg-base, #fff)); color: #2f5fcc; font: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .1em; writing-mode: vertical-rl; cursor: pointer; transition: background 140ms, box-shadow 140ms; }
.dpm-coltab:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, #2f5fcc 16%, var(--dsw-alias-bg-base, #fff)); box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 #2f5fcc; }
.dpm-coltab:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #2f5fcc; outline-offset: -3px; }
.dpm-coltab svg { writing-mode: horizontal-tb; width: 15px; height: 15px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-coltab { color: #8fb0ff; background: color-mix(in srgb, #6c97ff 12%, #161618); border-left-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1); }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-coltab:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, #6c97ff 20%, #161618); box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 #6c97ff; }
@keyframes dpm-colflash { 0% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(108, 151, 255, .9); } 100% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(108, 151, 255, 0); } }
.dpm-colflash { animation: dpm-colflash 1s ease-out; }
/* 切到没有关联卡片的会话：详情收起时的「保持打开」提示条 */
.dpm-keep { position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 84px; z-index: 320; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px 8px 8px 14px; border-radius: 12px; background: #1f2126; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, .45); animation: dpm-keepin 180ms ease-out; }
.dpm-keep button { height: 28px; padding: 0 10px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: #6c97ff; color: #fff; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
.dpm-keep button.x { background: transparent; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .7); }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-keep { background: #f4f4f5; color: #111; }
@keyframes dpm-keepin { from { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, 6px); } }

/* v150 反馈（任务项卡片的悬停气泡跑到后面了）：甘特 / 面板的浮层根（悬停气泡、菜单、日期弹层）原来 z 70，
   面板独立成列后（z 79）、详情（z 80）、竖条（z 86）都压在它上面 → 浮层永远在所有列之上 */
.dpm-sc { z-index: 90; }
/* 同理：提示条（含「保持打开」按钮）和侧栏弹出菜单不能被面板 / 详情列压住 */
.dpm-toasts { z-index: 92; }
.dpm-pop { z-index: 91; }

/* ═══ v151（原型 v150 + 11-06 反馈）═══ */
/* 5(1) 任务说明自动保存开关 */
.dpm-goaltask .gt-asw { flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-left: 10px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); white-space: nowrap; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-asw .nksw { flex: none; position: relative; width: 28px; height: 16px; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--dsw-alias-border-l3); cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 160ms var(--ease); }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-asw .nksw::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 2px; left: 2px; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 17, 21, .25); transition: transform 160ms var(--ease); }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-asw .nksw[aria-checked="true"] { background: var(--pm-brand); }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-asw .nksw[aria-checked="true"]::after { transform: translateX(12px); }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-asw .nksw:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--pm-brand); outline-offset: 2px; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-as[data-st="off"] { color: #b45309; }
/* 5(2) 批量删除：确认态悬停仍红底白字 + 3 秒倒计时细条；删除中忙态；选中行淡出 */
.dpm-goaltask .gt-msgo.arm, .dpm-goaltask .gt-msgo.arm:hover:not(:disabled) { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #dc2626; border-color: #dc2626; color: #fff; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-msgo.arm:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #b91c1c; border-color: #b91c1c; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-msgo.arm::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; height: 2px; width: 100%; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .85); transform-origin: left; animation: dpm-mscd 3s linear forwards; }
@keyframes dpm-mscd { from { transform: scaleX(1); } to { transform: scaleX(0); } }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-msgo.busy, .dpm-goaltask .gt-msgo.busy:disabled { opacity: 1; cursor: progress; background: #dc2626; border-color: #dc2626; color: #fff; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-msgo.busy svg { animation: dpmAsSpin .8s linear infinite; }
.dpm-goaltask .gt-pick.gone { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(8px); transition: opacity 220ms ease, transform 220ms ease; pointer-events: none; }
/* 1(2) 任务弹窗底部「关联卡片会话」：状态图标 = 执行安排卡片同一套 .dpm-sst（会话执行中：绿底白圈转圈 + 光带扫过） */
.dpm-gfb .dpm-sst.dpm-gfst { flex: none; height: 22px; padding: 0 8px 0 2px; gap: 5px; font-size: 11.5px; border-radius: 999px; pointer-events: none; }
.dpm-gfb .dpm-sst.dpm-gfst .ic { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
.dpm-gfb.on > .lb { display: none; }
/* 3(2) 截止时间窗口：添加区两行 + 硬性 / 软性看得清（选中 = 红 / 蓝底白字，没选中前面一个小色点） */
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 6px 8px; align-items: center; }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd input[type="date"], .dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd input[type="text"] { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd > .btn { height: 30px; padding: 0 14px; }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd .seg2 { justify-self: end; height: 30px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 2px; gap: 2px; align-items: center; }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd .seg2 button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; height: 26px; padding: 0 11px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 650; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); background: none; box-shadow: none; }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd .seg2 button::before { content: ""; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #c0392b; }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd .seg2 button[data-nk="soft"]::before { background: #1d4ed8; }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd .seg2 button:hover:not(.on) { color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dsw-alias-label-primary) 7%, transparent); }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd .seg2 button.on[data-nk="hard"] { background: #c0392b; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 17, 21, .2); }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd .seg2 button.on[data-nk="soft"] { background: #1d4ed8; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 17, 21, .2); }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd .seg2 button.on::before { background: #fff; }
.dpm-sc .dmenu.ddlpop .dadd .seg2 button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--pm-brand); outline-offset: 1px; }
/* 1(2) 对话框文件胶囊：文件挪过地方（放到落盘项目 / 迁移）= 正常胶囊 + 小标「已挪」 */
[data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"][data-dpm-moved][data-dpm-fst="card"] > span > span::after { content: "已挪"; display: inline-block; margin-left: 3px; padding: 0 4px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(37, 99, 235, .1); color: #1d4ed8; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 14px; white-space: nowrap; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] [data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"][data-dpm-moved][data-dpm-fst="card"] > span > span::after { background: rgba(126, 166, 255, .16); color: #a9c2ff; }
/* 3(1) 甘特图目录格：执行中 = 绿色渐变 + 反白；会话执行中 = 亮光循环扫过（只动 transform；减少动画时关） */
/* v174：执行中行的填充 = 任务执行安排「执行中」卡片的 --cbg #1f7a45（原来是 #16a34a→#15803d 渐变，两处绿色不一致） */
.dpm .sched #rows .sc-row > .sc-name.ind-cell.dpm-dirrun, .dpm .sched #rows .sc-row:hover > .sc-name.ind-cell.dpm-dirrun, .dpm .sched #rows .sc-row.sel > .sc-name.ind-cell.dpm-dirrun { background: #1f7a45 !important; color: #fff; }
.dpm .sched #rows .sc-row.sel > .sc-name.ind-cell.dpm-dirrun { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, .85); }
.dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirrun .nm, .dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirrun .caret, .dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirrun .pchip { color: #fff !important; }
.dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirrun .sub > *, .dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirrun .dpm-runz { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .2) !important; color: #fff !important; border-color: transparent !important; }
.dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirrun .dpm-runz i { background: #fff !important; }
.dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirrun .ddlbtn, .dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirrun [data-ddl] { color: #fff !important; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .16) !important; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .35) !important; }
.dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirsweep { overflow: hidden; }
.dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirsweep::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 32%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .5) 50%, transparent 68%); transform: translateX(-100%); animation: dpm-dirsw 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
.dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirsweep:not(.dpm-dirrun)::after { background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 32%, rgba(34, 197, 94, .28) 50%, transparent 68%); }
@keyframes dpm-dirsw { 0% { transform: translateX(-100%); } 70%, 100% { transform: translateX(100%); } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dpm .sched #rows .sc-name.dpm-dirsweep::after { animation: none; opacity: 0; } }


/* ═══ v153：DSH 对话框里的引用按钮 —— 和任务说明同一套（宿主胶囊的 > span 就是按钮本体） ═══ */
/* 颜色写死（胶囊在宿主聊天区，不在 .dpm 根里，拿不到 --pm-brand-* 变量）—— 与 .nref 那套同色 */
[data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"] > span { position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: min(100%, 560px); padding: 2px 8px 2px 24px; border: 1px solid #c3d3f7; border-radius: 7px; background: #eaf0fd; color: #1c3d92; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 17px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; }
[data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"] > span > svg { display: none; }
/* 图标 = 插件图标（CSS mask），和说明框 / 气泡窗同一套字形；id 由 composer.ts 的 classify() 打在 data-dpm-ic 上 */
[data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"] > span::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 6px; top: 4px; width: 13px; height: 13px; background: currentColor; opacity: .92; -webkit-mask: var(--dpm-ic) center / contain no-repeat; mask: var(--dpm-ic) center / contain no-repeat; }
[data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"] > span > span { min-width: 0; max-width: none; overflow: visible; text-overflow: clip; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }
[data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"] > span:hover { background: #d9e4fb; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] [data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"] > span { border-color: #35508f; background: #1d2a4a; color: #b9ccff; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] [data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"] > span:hover { background: #26365e; }
/* v163 S10：知识卡胶囊 = 绿色（和知识库入口 / 卡片同一套）；类型由 composer.ts 的 classify() 打在 data-dpm-kind 上 */
[data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"][data-dpm-kind="kb"] > span { border-color: rgba(22, 101, 52, .3); background: #eefaf2; color: #166534; }
[data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"][data-dpm-kind="kb"] > span:hover { background: #e2f4e9; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] [data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"][data-dpm-kind="kb"] > span { border-color: rgba(122, 214, 161, .34); background: #16261d; color: #b8e8cb; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] [data-composer-chip="dsh-project-manager"][data-dpm-kind="kb"] > span:hover { background: #1c3126; }

/* ═══ v155 · 项目卡（卡片级）的会话状态：这张卡片自己的会话，多个才汇总 ═══
   和实施口径一致：项目卡只出现在「没拆任务」的项目上（有任务的项目，面板里放的是任务卡）；
   1 个会话 = 和任务卡完全一样（无数字、点一下直接打开）；多个才给数字 / +N；一个都没有 = 虚线「无会话」。 */
.dpm-sst.agg { padding-right: 7px; }
.dpm-sst .cnt, .dpm-sst .also { flex: none; display: inline-grid; place-items: center; min-width: 13px; height: 13px; padding: 0 3px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: .1px; }
.dpm-sst .cnt { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 24%, transparent); color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 90%, #000); }
.dpm-sst .also { background: transparent; min-width: 0; padding: 0; border-radius: 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 72%, var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary)); opacity: .9; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-sst .cnt { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 36%, transparent); color: #fff; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-sst .also { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 72%, #fff); }
/* 一个会话都没有：虚线灰标（不冒充「空闲中」、也不冒充「已归档」） */
.dpm-sst.s-none { --c: #94a3b8; border-style: dashed; background: transparent !important; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary) !important; cursor: default; padding: 0 7px; }
.dpm-sst.s-none .lb { font-weight: 550; opacity: .92; }
.dpm-sst.s-none::before { content: ""; flex: none; width: 11px; height: 2px; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px; background: currentColor; opacity: .45; }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .dpm-sst.s-none { color: color-mix(in srgb, #94a3b8 82%, #fff) !important; }
/* 窄了只剩图标 + 数字；「无会话」三个字没有图标，所以窄容器里也保留文字 */
@container (max-width: 250px) {
  .dpm .sched #exBody .exi > .v40ex .dpm-sst.agg { padding: 0 4px; gap: 3px; }
  .dpm .sched #exBody .exi > .v40ex .dpm-sst.s-none { padding: 0 6px; }
  .dpm .sched #exBody .exi > .v40ex .dpm-sst.s-none .lb { display: block !important; }
}
@container (max-width: 400px) {
  .dpm .sched #tpList .plr > .v40pl .dpm-sst.s-none { padding: 0 6px; }
  .dpm .sched #tpList .plr > .v40pl .dpm-sst.s-none .lb { display: block !important; }
}
/* 深色下 gold / ext / gone 的描边底色仍是各自那套（见上面几节），这里不用重复 */

/* ═══ v158 / v159 项目看板搜索：结果栏 / 分组结果 / 空态 / 最近搜索卡片（与原型 dsh-web-v159.html 同一份规则） ═══ */
/* v158：页头搜索框（加宽 336 + ⌘K 提示 + 清除按钮） */
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox { position: relative; flex: 0 0 auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .search { width: 336px; min-width: 190px; max-width: 40vw; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .search:focus-within { border-color: var(--pm-brand); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--pm-brand-soft); background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-base); }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .search input::-webkit-search-cancel-button,
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .search input::-webkit-search-decoration { display: none; appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .qk { flex: none; height: 20px; padding: 0 5px; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); border-radius: 5px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-base); font-size: 10px; line-height: 18px; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .qclr { position: absolute; right: 3px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); display: grid; place-items: center; width: 20px; height: 20px; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; background: transparent; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .qclr:hover { background: var(--pm-select); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .qclr[hidden] { display: none; }
:is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .search:focus-within + .qk { opacity: 0; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { :is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .search { width: 220px; } :is(.dpm, .dpm-dialog) .pm-top .searchbox .qk { display: none; } }
/* 搜索页：整块替代看板，顶部是结果栏（查询 / 计数 / 范围 / 类型 / 返回），下面是分组结果 */
.v158 { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 6px 2px 20px; }
.v158-top { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 6; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; margin: 0 -2px; padding: 9px 2px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l1); background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-module-platform); }
.v158-sum { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; min-height: 26px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); }
.v158-sum { cursor: default; }
.v158-sum .v158sl { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 16px; height: 16px; color: var(--pm-brand); }
.v158lbl { flex: none; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .05em; }
.v158-sum .v158sl svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.9; stroke-linecap: round; }
.v158q { max-width: min(58vw, 680px); overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
.v158qs { font-size: 12.5px !important; font-weight: 600 !important; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary) !important; letter-spacing: 0 !important; }
.v158n { flex: none; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.v158ms { flex: none; font-size: 10px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); opacity: .7; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.v158f { flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 18px; padding: 0 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand) 10%, transparent); color: var(--pm-brand); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 650; }
.v158-filters { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; min-width: 0; }
.v158-scope { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px; padding: 2px; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); border-radius: 9px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-layer-1); }
.v158-scope button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; height: 26px; padding: 0 9px; border: 0; border-radius: 7px; background: transparent; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 140ms, color 140ms; }
.v158-scope button:hover { background: var(--pm-select); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); }
.v158-scope button.on { background: var(--pm-brand-soft); color: var(--pm-brand); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--pm-brand-line); }
.v158-scope button i { font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 650; opacity: .72; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.v158div { width: 1px; height: 18px; margin: 0 1px; background: var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); }
.v158-types { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px; }
.v158-types button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; height: 28px; padding: 0 8px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 7px; background: transparent; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 550; cursor: pointer; }
.v158-types button:hover { background: var(--pm-select); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); }
.v158-types button.on { border-color: var(--pm-brand-line); background: var(--pm-brand-soft); color: var(--pm-brand); font-weight: 650; }
.v158-types button i { font-style: normal; font-size: 10px; opacity: .7; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.v158reset { height: 26px; padding: 0 7px; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; background: transparent; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font: inherit; font-size: 11px; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; cursor: pointer; }
.v158reset:hover { color: var(--pm-brand); }
.v158ktip { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); opacity: .72; white-space: nowrap; }
.v158back { margin-left: 4px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; height: 28px; padding: 0 10px 0 8px; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-base); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); font: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 550; cursor: pointer; transition: border-color 140ms, background-color 140ms; }
.v158back:hover, .v158back:focus-visible { border-color: var(--pm-brand-line); background: var(--pm-brand-soft); color: var(--pm-brand); outline: none; }
.v158back svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }

/* 分组 */
.v158-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
.v158-sec { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; animation: v158in 230ms var(--ease) both; }
.v158-sec:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 40ms; }
.v158-sec:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 80ms; }
@keyframes v158in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(5px); } }
.v158-sh { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .02em; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); }
.v158-sh svg { flex: none; width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.7; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.v158-sh em { flex: none; height: 18px; padding: 0 6px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-module-platform); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 18px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.v158-sh > i { flex: 1 1 auto; height: 1px; min-width: 12px; background: var(--dsw-alias-border-l1); }
.v158shx { flex: none; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); opacity: .75; }
.v158-rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }

/* 结果行：卡片 / 卡片组 / 落盘项目共用骨架 */
.v158r { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-layer-1); text-align: left; cursor: pointer; transition: border-color 140ms var(--ease), background-color 140ms var(--ease), box-shadow 140ms var(--ease); }
.v158r:hover { border-color: var(--pm-brand-line); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand-soft) 20%, var(--dsw-alias-bg-layer-1)); }
.v158r.on { border-color: var(--pm-brand); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand-soft) 44%, var(--dsw-alias-bg-layer-1)); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand) 10%, transparent); }
.v158r:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--pm-brand); outline-offset: 2px; }
.v158ic { flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-module-platform); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); }
.v158ic svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.65; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.v158-r-lf .v158ic { background: var(--pm-brand-soft); color: var(--pm-brand); }
.v158m { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; min-width: 0; }
.v158t { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.42; }
.v158tt { min-width: 0; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.v158pj { color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 550; white-space: nowrap; }
.v158pj b { margin: 0 1px; font-weight: 500; opacity: .7; }
.v158sub { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; min-width: 0; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.5; }
.v158sub i { font-style: normal; opacity: .5; }
.v158sub.v158stat { display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 1; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.v158lfs { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; }
.v158chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; max-width: 190px; height: 19px; padding: 0 6px; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-module-platform); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 550; }
.v158chip svg { flex: none; width: 11px; height: 11px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.7; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.v158chip > span { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.v158chip.arch { border-style: dashed; background: transparent; }
.v158more { flex: none; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 10px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.v158b { flex: none; height: 18px; padding: 0 6px; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-module-platform); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 16px; white-space: nowrap; }
.v158b.arch { border-style: dashed; background: transparent; }
.v158b.live { background: transparent; }
.v158side { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; justify-self: end; min-width: 0; }
.v158why { max-width: 280px; height: 19px; padding: 0 7px; border-radius: 6px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand) 9%, transparent); color: var(--pm-brand); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 19px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.v158loc { flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 7px; background: transparent; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); opacity: 0; cursor: pointer; transition: opacity 120ms, background-color 120ms, color 120ms; }
.v158r:hover .v158loc, .v158r.on .v158loc, .v158r:focus-within .v158loc { opacity: 1; }
.v158loc:hover, .v158loc:focus-visible { background: var(--pm-select); color: var(--pm-brand); outline: none; }
.v158loc svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.7; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.v158go { flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 14px; height: 18px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); opacity: .35; }
.v158go svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.9; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.v158r:hover .v158go, .v158r.on .v158go { opacity: .9; color: var(--pm-brand); }
.v158ent { flex: none; width: 16px; color: var(--pm-brand); font-size: 12px; text-align: center; opacity: 0; }
.v158r.on .v158ent { opacity: .75; }

/* 落盘项目行：可展开它对应的卡片 */
.v158lfb { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.v158lfb.open .v158r-lf { border-bottom-left-radius: 0; border-bottom-right-radius: 0; }
.v158cnt { flex: none; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 10.5px; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.v158chev { flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 22px; height: 22px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); }
.v158chev svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; transition: transform 180ms var(--ease); }
.v158lfb.open .v158chev svg { transform: rotate(180deg); }
.v158lfc { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); border-top: 0; border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-layer-1); }
.v158lc { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto auto; grid-template-rows: auto auto; align-items: center; gap: 1px 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: transparent; color: inherit; font: inherit; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; }
.v158lc:hover, .v158lc:focus-visible { background: var(--pm-select); outline: none; }
.v158lc > .v158lct { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; }
.v158lc > .v158lcs { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 10.5px; }
.v158lc > .v158b { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
.v158lcg { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1 / span 2; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1px; color: var(--pm-brand); font-size: 10.5px; opacity: 0; }
.v158lc:hover .v158lcg, .v158lc:focus-visible .v158lcg { opacity: 1; }
.v158lcg svg { width: 11px; height: 11px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.9; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.v158lcm { padding: 4px 10px 6px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 10.5px; }

/* 卡片详情里的「关联的落盘项目」：两行（名称 / 项目 + 状态），窄详情也读得全 */
#cdBody .crow.v158mem { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 3px 8px; padding: 7px 8px; }
#cdBody .crow.v158mem .nm2 { flex: 1 1 100%; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 650; }
#cdBody .crow.v158mem .path { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
#cdBody .crow.v158mem .tag { flex: 0 1 auto; max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
/* 高亮：只标命中的字，不整行变色 */
.v158 mark { padding: 0 1px; border-radius: 3px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand) 20%, transparent); color: inherit; box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 color-mix(in srgb, var(--pm-brand) 42%, transparent); }
body[data-ds-dark-theme] .v158 mark { background: color-mix(in srgb, #8fb0ff 30%, transparent); }

/* 空态 / 无结果 */
.v158-empty { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 9px; max-width: 760px; margin: 36px auto 18px; padding: 0 4px; text-align: center; }
.v158-ei { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--pm-brand-soft); color: var(--pm-brand); }
.v158-ei svg { width: 23px; height: 23px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.65; stroke-linecap: round; }
.v158-empty h2 { margin: 2px 0 0; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
.v158-empty p { max-width: 620px; margin: 0; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.72; }
.v158-empty p b { color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); font-weight: 650; }
.v158-ex, .v158-sug { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 3px; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 11.5px; }
.v158p { height: 26px; padding: 0 9px; border: 1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2); border-radius: 7px; background: var(--dsw-alias-bg-base); color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary); font: inherit; font-size: 11.5px; cursor: pointer; transition: border-color 130ms, background-color 130ms, color 130ms; }
.v158p:hover, .v158p:focus-visible { border-color: var(--pm-brand-line); background: var(--pm-brand-soft); color: var(--pm-brand); outline: none; }
.v158rec { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 2px; }
.v158recl { color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font-size: 11px; }
.v158recs { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; }
.v158recc { border: 0; background: none; color: var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary); font: inherit; font-size: 10.5px; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; cursor: pointer; }
